{"rowNumber":1287,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#23","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Haah...\"","korean":"\"하아...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1288,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#32","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"Hm? Barely two steps in the door and you're already looking defeated. What's wrong?\"","korean":"\"응? 교실에 들어오자마자 벌써 넋이 나갔네. 무슨 일이야?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1289,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#36","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Nothing. Everything's fine, don't worry.\"","korean":"\"아무것도 아냐. 다 괜찮아, 걱정 마.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1290,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#40","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"You seem pretty tired lately. You sure?\"","korean":"\"요즘 좀 피곤해 보이던데. 진짜 괜찮아?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1291,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#44","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Yeah, really, I'm fine. I appreciate it, though.\"","korean":"\"응, 진짜 괜찮아. 그래도 고마워.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1292,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#51","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"It's been a week since the bathtub incident with Seohee-noona.","korean":"서희 누나와 목욕탕에서 있었던 일 이후 일주일이 지났다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1293,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#55","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"My daily routine at school hasn't changed any. I arrive, I chat with my friends, attend class, then go home.","korean":"학교에서의 일상은 바뀌지 않았다. 등교하고, 친구들과 수다 떨고, 수업 듣고, 집에 간다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1294,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#58","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"That's how my days go, and how they've always gone.","korean":"그게 내 하루이고, 항상 그래 왔다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1295,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#61","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"However...","korean":"하지만...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1296,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#73","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"My private life has gone in a completely new direction since that day.","korean":"사생활은 그날 이후로 완전히 다른 방향으로 흘러가고 있다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1297,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#79","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Seohee-noona has been luring me into more \"situations\" with her every single day, and I'm pretty sure my body is struggling to produce enough semen to replace the constant outward flow.","korean":"서희 누나와 야릇한 일을 벌이는 날이 계속되고 있다. 연달아 사정하다 보니 몸이 정액을 다시 만들어 낼 틈도 없는 것 같다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1298,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#85","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She teases me, unveils more and more of her charming body, and flashes that sexy smile of hers.","korean":"누나는 나를 놀리고, 매력적인 몸을 조금씩 더 드러내며, 야릇한 미소를 짓는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1299,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#98","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Minjae... Maybe, maybe something is wrong with me.\"","korean":"\"민재야... 아무래도 나 어디가 좀 이상한가 봐.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1300,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#107","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"Hm? I knew there was something going on with you. Fear not, I got just the thing. I prescribe you the treatment of one good fap sesh, and here is your medicine: another juicy magazine.\"","korean":"\"응? 역시 뭔가 있었네. 걱정 마, 딱 맞는 처방이 있으니까. 시원하게 한 번 빼고 나면 나아질 거야. 자, 약은 새로 나온 성인 잡지다.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1301,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#110","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"My friend, cumming far too much is the issue I'm trying to solve here...","korean":"너무 자주 싸 버리는 게 바로 내가 해결하려는 문제인데...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1302,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#119","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"As I sigh I rummage under the table to get some textbooks when...","korean":"한숨을 쉬며 책상 밑에서 교과서를 찾다가...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1303,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#123","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Huh? The hell is this?\"","korean":"\"응? 이게 뭐지?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1304,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#131","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I notice a letter and retrieve it.","korean":"편지를 발견하고 꺼낸다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1305,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#135","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"It's sealed with a cute animal sticker. I open it, and discover that the paper it is written on is pretty adorable as well.","korean":"귀여운 동물 스티커로 봉해져 있다. 열어 보니 편지지 자체도 꽤 귀엽다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1306,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#138","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Wait, don't tell me...","korean":"잠깐, 설마...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1307,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#145","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"I-Isn't that a love letter?!\"","korean":"\"이, 이건 러브레터 아니야?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1308,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#150","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Woah!\"","korean":"\"우왓!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1309,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#155","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"Yuuki, you disgusting traitor! Here I was thinking that we were virgin brothers for life! Get ready to pay the penalty for breaching the contract, you little shit!\"","korean":"\"이 배신자 새끼! 평생 아다 동지인 줄 알았는데! 계약 위반이니까 위약금 내, 이 자식아!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1310,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#160","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I don't remember signing any contract like that... But hey, how about you quit peeking at my private stuff?\"","korean":"\"그런 계약 한 기억은 없는데... 근데 내 사생활 훔쳐보지 마.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1311,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#165","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"Sorry bro, my curiosity got the better of me there. So tell me, what's the letter say?\"","korean":"\"미안, 호기심을 못 이겼어. 그래서 편지에 뭐라고 써 있어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1312,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#169","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"U-Um...\"","korean":"\"그, 그게...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1313,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#178","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"The handwriting looks very feminine. The letter says...","korean":"글씨가 여성스럽다. 편지 내용은...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1314,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#182","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"\"After school, please come to the classroom below. There's something I'd like to tell you there.\"","korean":"\"방과 후에 아래층 교실로 와 주세요. 할 말이 있어요.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1315,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#191","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"I-It really is a love letter...\"","korean":"\"지, 진짜 러브레터네...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1316,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#195","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"So it seems. What should I do about it?\"","korean":"\"그런 것 같아. 어떻게 하지?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1317,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#200","kind":"text","speaker":"민재","english":"\"What do you mean, 'what should I do?!' You gotta get your ass over to that classroom, my man! That's the only choice!\"","korean":"\"뭘 어떡해?! 당장 그 교실로 가야지! 다른 선택지가 어디 있어!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1318,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#204","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Y-Yeah, I know, but...\"","korean":"\"아, 알아, 근데...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1319,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#212","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I don't know why, but for some reason I kinda feel down about receiving this letter. Shouldn't I be jumping for joy right about now?","korean":"왜인지 모르겠지만, 이 편지를 받으니 기분이 좀 가라앉는다. 원래 기뻐서 펄쩍 뛰어야 하는 거 아닌가?","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1320,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#216","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Maybe it's just because I'm only seeing the letter and not the author.","korean":"편지를 봤을 뿐, 보낸 사람을 본 게 아니라서 그런가.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1321,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#219","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"My feelings will probably change once I see this mysterious girl in person. Yeah, that's it.","korean":"편지를 보낸 그 애를 직접 보면 기분도 달라지겠지. 그래, 분명 그럴 거야.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1322,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#229","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"...","korean":"...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1323,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#237","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"School is over. It's time for my meeting.","korean":"수업이 끝났다. 약속 시간이다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1324,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#244","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I make my way to the requested classroom in the letter.","korean":"편지에 적힌 교실로 향한다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1325,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#248","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"The girl must be in there; assuming this isn't a prank, of course.","korean":"장난만 아니라면 그 여자애가 안에 있을 것이다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1326,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#259","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I steel myself and enter the classroom.","korean":"마음을 다잡고 교실에 들어간다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1327,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#272","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Ah! K-Lee! You... came...\"","korean":"\"아! 준, 준형아! 와... 왔구나...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1328,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#281","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"There's a girl standing by the window. I can't recall her name, but I do remember having seen her before.","korean":"창가에 여자애가 서 있다. 이름은 기억나지 않지만, 본 적은 있다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1329,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#292","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Oh yeah. We were in the same class last year, weren't we?\"","korean":"\"아, 맞다. 작년에 같은 반이었지?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1330,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#297","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"That's right. It makes me so happy to hear that you remember, even though we didn't really talk all that much.\"","korean":"\"응. 별로 이야기도 나누지 않았는데 기억해 줘서 기뻐.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1331,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#300","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She blushes and turns her face away in embarrassment.","korean":"얼굴을 붉히며 시선을 돌린다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1332,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#304","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She's a quiet girl, and never stood out in class - but she still left an impression on me.","korean":"조용하고 반에서 눈에 띄는 편은 아니었지만, 이상하게 기억에 남는 애였다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1333,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#308","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I remember a number of positive things about her, but my most vivid memories are of how caring she was.","korean":"좋은 기억이 몇 가지 있는데, 가장 선명한 건 배려심이 깊었다는 점이다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1334,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#312","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She would water the flowers in class when nobody's around, would feed the fish...","korean":"아무도 안 볼 때 교실 화분에 물을 주고, 어항 물고기 밥도 챙기고...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1335,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#316","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Little things, of course, but those are the kind of tasks that other people would consider a bother rather than enjoyable.","korean":"사소한 일이지만, 다른 사람들은 귀찮아할 만한 일을 스스로 했다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1336,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#319","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I tell her about my memories of her.","korean":"기억나는 걸 그대로 말해 준다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1337,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#324","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"S-So that's the image you had of me... Ehehe.\"","korean":"\"그, 그렇게 봤구나... 에헤헤.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1338,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#328","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She chuckles softly, clearly embarassed. She's very cute, and gives off a completely different vibe than my sister does.","korean":"부끄러워하며 작게 웃는다. 정말 귀엽다. 누나와는 완전히 다른 분위기다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1339,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#332","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"My sister... She has the face of a goddess, and a body more stunning than a model's. Just thinking about her makes my heart race.","korean":"누나... 여신 같은 얼굴에, 모델보다 더 멋진 몸. 생각만 해도 심장이 뛴다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1340,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#337","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Don't you remember helping me too, Lee?\"","korean":"\"준형이가 나를 도와준 것도 기억 안 나?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1341,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#341","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Huh?\"","korean":"\"응?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1342,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#346","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"I-I mean, whenever I struggled to lift something heavy, you would always be there to take care of it for me.\"","korean":"\"무거운 거 들기 힘들 때마다, 항상 와서 도와줬잖아.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1343,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#350","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Oh, r-right, I did, didn't I?\"","korean":"\"아, 마, 맞다, 그랬지.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1344,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#354","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Shit. This isn't the time to be fantasizing about my sister's body. I should focus on the girl right in front of me.","korean":"씨발. 지금 누나 몸 상상할 때가 아니다. 눈앞의 여자에게 집중해야 한다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1345,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#359","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Y-Yeah... You really helped me a lot, Lee...\"","korean":"\"으, 응... 많이 도와줬어, 준형아...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1346,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#364","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"And after other people saw how you took the initiative to help me, they started to help too.\"","korean":"\"그리고 네가 먼저 도와주는 걸 보고, 다른 사람들도 도와주기 시작했어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1347,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#369","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Thanks to your kindness, I was able to make plenty of friends, and my view of myself finally started to get brighter again.\"","korean":"\"네 친절 덕분에 친구도 많이 생겼고, 나 스스로도 조금씩 자신감이 생겼어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1348,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#374","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Thanks to you, I got better. That's why I... Well, I...\"","korean":"\"다 네 덕분이야. 그래서 나... 그게...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1349,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#384","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She walks towards me, her pace slow.","korean":"천천히 나에게 걸어온다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1350,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#395","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She stops just a couple steps away, and looks at me straight in the eyes.","korean":"두세 걸음 앞에서 멈추고, 내 눈을 똑바로 바라본다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1351,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#400","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Lee, I, um... There's something I'd really like to tell you.\"","korean":"\"준형아, 나, 음... 정말 하고 싶은 말이 있어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1352,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#403","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"A gentle breeze flutters in through the window.","korean":"창문으로 부드러운 바람이 들어온다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1353,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#407","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"The redness in her cheeks still hasn't faded. She begins to speak, with a newfound confidence in her voice.","korean":"볼의 홍조가 아직 가시지 않았다. 그래도 아까보다 한결 또렷한 목소리로 입을 연다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1354,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#410","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Her voice resounds throughout the empty classroom, overpowering the wind.","korean":"그 목소리가 빈 교실에 울려 퍼지며 바람 소리를 압도한다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1355,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#413","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"And...","korean":"그리고...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1356,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#419","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"I... I love you, Lee! And I have ever since last year... I've loved you, ever since I met you!\"","korean":"\"나... 준형이를 좋아해! 작년부터... 만난 그 순간부터 계속 좋아했어!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1357,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#422","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She conveys her feelings to me with utmost sincerity.","korean":"온 마음을 담아 자기 마음을 전해 온다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1358,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#427","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"I know that having someone dump their feelings on you can be a hassle, but... I just need to know, will you...\"","korean":"\"갑자기 이런 말 하면 부담스러울 수도 있다는 거 알아. 그래도... 꼭 알고 싶어. 혹시...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1359,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#431","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Will you... be my boyfriend?\"","korean":"\"나랑... 사귀어 줄래?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1360,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#435","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Her eyes remain fixed on mine, her face beet red, tears streaming down her cheeks.","korean":"새빨개진 얼굴로 눈물을 흘리면서도, 그 애는 내 눈을 똑바로 바라보고 있다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1361,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#439","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"It's as clear as day that she truly carries a torch for me.","korean":"진심으로 나를 좋아한다는 게 너무 분명하다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1362,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#443","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I'm happy about it.","korean":"기쁘다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1363,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#446","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I really am.","korean":"정말 기쁘다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1364,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#449","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Not because this is the first time a girl has confessed to me, either.","korean":"그렇다고 여자애에게 처음 고백받아서 이런 기분이 드는 것도 아니다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1365,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#453","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"It is her confession itself that makes me happy. Her sincere affection moves me.","korean":"고백 그 자체가 기쁘다. 진심 어린 그 마음에 가슴이 뭉클해진다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1366,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#459","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Don't you want to... go out with me?\"","korean":"\"나랑... 사귀기 싫어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1367,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#462","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I have no reason to refuse her.","korean":"거절할 이유가 없다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1368,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#465","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"No reason whatsoever, but...","korean":"아무런 이유도 없다. 그런데...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1369,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#476","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Oh, um, err...\"","korean":"\"아, 음, 그게...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1370,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#479","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I can't give her a proper answer.","korean":"제대로 된 대답을 할 수 없다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1371,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#482","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Something deep inside is telling me that I can't accept her.","korean":"마음 깊은 곳에서 받아들일 수 없다고 말하고 있다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1372,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#487","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"...I'm sorry.\"","korean":"\"...미안해.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1373,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#492","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Ah!\"","korean":"\"아!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1374,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#495","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I thoughtlessly dash her hopes.","korean":"생각할 틈도 없이 그 애의 기대를 꺾어 버렸다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1375,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#499","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"But, as if mustering the remainder of her courage, the girl opens her mouth to speak once more.","korean":"하지만 남은 용기를 짜내듯, 다시 입을 연다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1376,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#505","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"Just give me a reason... Please, tell me why I'm not good enough... I'll get better... I'll try to fix it...\"","korean":"\"이유만이라도... 왜 부족한지 알려 줘... 나아질게... 노력할게...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1377,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#510","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I'm sorry. I don't know the answer myself.\"","korean":"\"미안해. 나도 답을 모르겠어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1378,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#518","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"\"No way!","korean":"\"그럴 리가...!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1379,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#524","kind":"text","speaker":"여자애","english":"...Kgh!\"","korean":"...윽!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1380,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#529","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She bursts out the door with teary eyes.","korean":"눈물 가득한 눈으로 문을 박차고 나간다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1381,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#532","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I can't do anything but stand and watch her go.","korean":"나는 서서 그 뒷모습만 바라볼 수밖에 없다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1382,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#546","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"...\"","korean":"\"...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1383,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#555","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I sink into the sofa as soon as I get home.","korean":"집에 오자마자 소파에 주저앉는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1384,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#559","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Why did I reject her? I had no reason to.","korean":"왜 거절했을까? 거절할 이유는 없었는데.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1385,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#563","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She's a cute girl with a great personality, and she had heartfelt feelings for me.","korean":"귀엽고 성격 좋은 여자애였고, 진심으로 나를 좋아했다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1386,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#567","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"And without a second thought, I coldly rejected her. I made her cry.","korean":"그런데 나는 깊이 생각해 보지도 않고 차갑게 거절했다. 울리기까지 했다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1387,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#571","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I'm the fucking worst...\"","korean":"\"나 진짜 최악이다...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1388,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#575","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Why did I do that? Why did I keep telling myself that I shouldn't accept her?","korean":"왜 그랬을까? 왜 받아들이면 안 된다고 계속 생각했지?","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1389,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#578","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I think and think, but no answer comes to mind.","korean":"생각하고 또 생각해도 답이 안 나온다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1390,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#582","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I sink further into the sofa, feeling nothing but self-hatred.","korean":"소파에 더 깊이 파묻히며 자기혐오만 느낀다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1391,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#586","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"...\"","korean":"\"...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1392,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#595","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"But I notice a faint, pleasant smell emanating from the cushion.","korean":"그런데 쿠션에서 희미하고 기분 좋은 냄새가 난다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1393,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#599","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"It's slightly sweet, and puts me at ease. It's Seohee-noona's scent.","korean":"살짝 달콤하고, 마음이 편해진다. 서희 누나 냄새다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1394,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#603","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Seohee-noona...\"","korean":"\"서희 누나...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1395,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#607","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I bring the cushion into my chest and hug it tightly.","korean":"쿠션을 가슴에 끌어안고 꽉 안는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1396,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#611","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Man, it smells heavenly. Just having that scent fill my nostrils calms me down.","korean":"냄새가 천국 같다. 그 향만으로도 마음이 가라앉는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1397,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#620","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Seohee-noona and I actually slept together on this sofa a lot back when we were little.","korean":"어릴 때 이 소파에서 누나와 같이 잔 적이 많다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1398,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#624","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Whenever I was having a rough time or was upset about something, she would always rush to be there for me.","korean":"힘들거나 속상할 때마다 누나가 항상 달려와 줬다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1399,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#628","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She would listen to my problems and treat them seriously, and do her best to cheer me up. She'd hug me tight, and sleep with me right here.","korean":"누나는 내 고민을 진지하게 들어 주고 최선을 다해 위로해 줬다. 나를 꼭 안아 주고, 바로 여기서 함께 잠들어 주기도 했다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1400,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#632","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Her leftover scent makes me remember those days fondly.","korean":"남아 있는 향기에 그 시절이 그립게 떠오른다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1401,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#641","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Seohee-noona...\"","korean":"\"서희 누나...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1402,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#645","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"But it also makes me feel even lonelier, as the mere scent is no substitute for the person herself.","korean":"하지만 동시에 더 외로워진다. 향기만으로는 그 사람을 대신할 수 없으니까.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1403,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#648","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I want to see you. Seohee-noona... Noona, I need you...","korean":"보고 싶어. 서희 누나... 누나가 필요해...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1404,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#652","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Noo... na...\"","korean":"\"누... 나...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1405,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#656","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I call for her in a somber tone while on the brink of tears.","korean":"울먹이며 침울한 목소리로 부른다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1406,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#659","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"But there's nobody here to help m?","korean":"하지만 도와줄 사람은 여기 없—","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1407,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#673","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Yes?\"","korean":"\"응?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1408,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#679","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Huh?! O-O-Noona?!\"","korean":"\"어?! 누, 누나?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1409,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#690","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Yup, I just got home. You were calling for me, right?\"","korean":"\"응, 방금 왔어. 나를 불렀지?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1410,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#702","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She's really here! God has heard my prayers!","korean":"진짜 와 있다! 신이 기도를 들어준 거다!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1411,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#707","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Aah! I knew she was different from all the others! She has cleansed my soul!","korean":"아아! 역시 누나는 다른 사람들과 달랐어! 영혼을 정화해 줬다!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1412,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#711","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I was feeling depressed just a moment ago, but just seeing her face has filled me with joy!","korean":"방금 전까지 우울했는데, 얼굴만 봐도 기쁨이 차오른다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1413,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#721","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Are you okay, Junhyung? You don't look so good... Did something happen?\"","korean":"\"괜찮아, 준형아? 표정이 안 좋은데... 무슨 일 있었어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1414,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#725","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Her eyes are sharp. My wounded heart didn't escape her.","korean":"역시 눈치가 빠르다. 내가 풀 죽어 있는 걸 바로 알아챘다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1415,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#731","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Would you like to talk about it?\"","korean":"\"이야기할래?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1416,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#735","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Well, uh...\"","korean":"\"그게, 음...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1417,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#738","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I hesitate to unload my problems on her.","korean":"고민을 털어놓기가 망설여진다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1418,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#743","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Wouldn't it be rather effeminate of me to tell her about how I'm feeling depressed because I turned down a girl and made her cry?","korean":"고백 거절하고 우울해졌다고 말하는 게 너무 나약하게 보이는 거 아닐까.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1419,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#747","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She might get disappointed in me if I tell her about that.","korean":"그 일을 말하면 누나가 나에게 실망할지도 모른다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1420,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#754","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Okay, I get it. Come here, Junhyung.\"","korean":"\"알겠어. 이리 와, 준형아.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1421,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#759","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Eh?! O-Noona?!\"","korean":"\"어?! 누, 누나?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1422,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#763","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She pulls me towards her and leads me out of the room.","korean":"나를 끌어당겨 방 밖으로 이끈다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1423,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#771","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"And we walk towards...","korean":"그렇게 향한 곳은...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1424,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#782","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Woah...\"","korean":"\"와...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1425,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#785","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"H-H-Her room!","korean":"누, 누나 방!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1426,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#789","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"It smells DIVINE in here! This blows that cushion on the sofa out of the water!","korean":"여기 냄새가 신성하다! 소파 쿠션은 상대도 안 된다!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1427,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#795","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"I'll bring you a cold drink, okay?\"","korean":"\"찬 음료 갖다 줄게, 알았지?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1428,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#799","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Ah, sure...\"","korean":"\"아, 응...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1429,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#810","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She leaves the room.","korean":"방을 나간다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1430,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#814","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"When was the last time I was in here? I stopped coming into her room at some point in the past, but I had no idea it changed this much since then.","korean":"마지막으로 여기 온 게 언제지? 어느 순간부터 누나 방에 안 들어오게 됐는데, 그새 이렇게 많이 바뀐 줄은 몰랐다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1431,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#818","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"...\"","korean":"\"...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1432,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#825","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Her bed...","korean":"침대...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1433,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#829","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She sleeps there every night, so I bet that her scent is even stronger over there!","korean":"매일 밤 저기서 자니까, 냄새가 더 진할 거야!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1434,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#833","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"W-What should I do? The weak scent of the sofa cushion already put me in a strange mood.","korean":"어, 어떻게 하지? 소파 쿠션에 밴 희미한 향만으로도 이상한 기분이 들었는데.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1435,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#837","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I just want to dive in! I want to stick my nose right into her pillow!","korean":"뛰어들고 싶다! 베개에 코를 처박고 싶어!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1436,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#841","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I want to jump into her bed and be surrounded by lovely fragrance!","korean":"침대에 뛰어들어 그 향기에 둘러싸이고 싶다!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1437,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#850","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"W-What the hell am I thinking?!\"","korean":"\"내, 내가 무슨 생각을 하는 거야?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1438,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#854","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"G-Gotta calm down! If I don't calm myself down before she comes back, I'll... I'll...","korean":"진, 진정해야 해! 돌아오기 전에 진정하지 않으면... 나... 나...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1439,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#860","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Haah... haah... haah... haah...\"","korean":"\"하아... 하아... 하아... 하아...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1440,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#864","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"...\"","korean":"\"...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1441,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#868","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Waaaaaaah! It's useless to resist!","korean":"으아아아아! 저항해도 소용없다!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1442,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#872","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Taking in a lungful in a room filled with her fragrance has the complete opposite effect on my faint heart!","korean":"누나 향기로 가득한 방에서 숨을 들이마시는 건 진정과는 정반대 효과다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1443,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#875","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"W-Wait! No, now is NOT the time to pitch a tent!","korean":"자, 잠깐! 지금 텐트 칠 때가 아니야!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1444,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#884","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Room service! Here's your drink.\"","korean":"\"룸서비스! 음료 가져왔어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1445,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#889","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Waaaaaah?!\"","korean":"\"으아아아아?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1446,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#899","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"What's the matter? It's a little rude to just scream into someone's face, you know.\"","korean":"\"왜 그래? 남의 얼굴에 대고 비명 지르는 건 좀 무례하지 않아?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1447,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#903","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I-I'm sorry! The door suddenly opening just took me by surprise, is all.\"","korean":"\"미, 미안! 문이 갑자기 열려서 놀란 거야.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1448,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#913","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Hehe. Is that so? It's not because I interrupted you thinking about doing something like... taking a peek into my wardrobe, is it?\"","korean":"\"헤에... 그래? 혹시 누나 옷장이라도 몰래 들여다볼까 생각하다가 방해받은 건 아니고?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1449,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#917","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"O-O-Of course not!\"","korean":"\"아, 아, 아니야!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1450,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#924","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"You sure? I don't have a problem with you taking a peek.\"","korean":"\"정말? 몰래 들여다봐도 누나는 상관없는데.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1451,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#929","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Don't even joke about that! What kind of degenerate would rifle through his older sister's dresser?!\"","korean":"\"그런 농담 하지 마! 누나 옷장을 뒤지는 이상한 놈이 어디 있어?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1452,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#937","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"I won't think that of you, so don't worry. Go on, don't you want to take a peek?\"","korean":"\"그렇게 생각 안 할 테니까 걱정 마. 자, 안 훔쳐보고 싶어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1453,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#941","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I-I-I said I ain't looking!\"","korean":"\"안, 안 본다고 했잖아!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1454,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#948","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Haha. Shy as always, I see.\"","korean":"\"하아... 역시 부끄럼쟁이라니까.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1455,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#956","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She sits beside me.","korean":"옆에 앉는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1456,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#960","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Aah! The smell is great and all, but it doesn't compare to having her right next to me!","korean":"아아! 냄새도 좋은데, 옆에 있는 것과는 비교가 안 된다!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1457,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#964","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I feel her warmth, and it makes my heart beat faster.","korean":"따뜻함이 느껴지고, 심장이 빨리 뛴다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1458,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#972","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"So, did something happen at school? Did someone bully you?\"","korean":"\"그래서, 학교에서 무슨 일 있었어? 누가 괴롭혔어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1459,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#976","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"In contrast to my excitement, her face turns serious as she asks me about my issue.","korean":"내 흥분과 달리, 내 문제를 묻자 표정이 진지해진다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1460,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#984","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"I won't tell anyone, so please do tell me what's wrong. Keeping something to yourself will only make it worse.\"","korean":"\"아무한테도 안 말할 테니까, 무슨 일인지 말해 줘. 혼자 끙끙 앓으면 더 힘들어져.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1461,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#992","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Noona...\"","korean":"\"누나...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1462,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1002","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Don't worry. I'm here for you, and always will be. You can talk to me about anything.\"","korean":"\"걱정 마. 나는 항상 네 편이야. 뭐든 말해도 돼.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1463,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1006","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She flashes a gentle smile and holds my hand in hers.","korean":"부드러운 미소를 지으며 내 손을 잡는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1464,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1010","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Though she teases me plenty, she always takes my problems seriously and wants to help.","korean":"놀리기는 많이 하지만, 고민은 항상 진지하게 듣고 도와주려고 한다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1465,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1013","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She genuinely cares about me so much.","korean":"진심으로 나를 많이 아낀다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1466,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1017","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Well, actually, today...\"","korean":"\"그게, 사실 오늘...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1467,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1023","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Mhm?\"","korean":"\"응?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1468,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1027","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"A girl... confessed to me.\"","korean":"\"여자애가... 고백했어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1469,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1033","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"She confessed?\"","korean":"\"고백했다고?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1470,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1038","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Y-Yes. I found a love letter stashed in my bag this morning, and in it she told me that I should meet her in a classroom after school.\"","korean":"\"으, 응. 아침에 가방에서 러브레터를 찾았고, 거기에 방과 후에 만나자고 적혀 있었어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1471,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1046","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Hmmmm?\"","korean":"\"흐으음?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1472,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1050","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"And...\"","korean":"\"그리고...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1473,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1056","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"And were you happy that she confessed to you?\"","korean":"\"그래서 고백 받아서 기뻤어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1474,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1060","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Huh? Well, um...\"","korean":"\"어? 그게, 음...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1475,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1066","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Oh? So you were happy about it.\"","korean":"\"오? 기뻤구나.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1476,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1072","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Was that girl cute?\"","korean":"\"그 여자애 귀여웠어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1477,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1076","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Y-Yeah. I thought she was pretty cute, but...\"","korean":"\"으, 응. 꽤 귀엽다고 생각했는데...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1478,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1087","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"I see, so you found her cute. Hmmm. You thought she was really cute.\"","korean":"\"그렇구나, 귀엽다고 생각했구나. 흐으음. 진짜 귀엽다고 생각했구나.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1479,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1090","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Wait a minute... She seems pretty upset.","korean":"잠깐... 화난 것 같다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1480,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1094","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Did I step on a landmine here? Did I bring up bad memories she has related to a confession or something?","korean":"지뢰를 밟은 건가? 고백과 관련된 안 좋은 기억을 건드린 건가?","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1481,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1101","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"And how did she confess to you?\"","korean":"\"그래서 어떻게 고백했어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1482,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1105","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Well... err...\"","korean":"\"그게... 음...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1483,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1111","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Answer me.\"","korean":"\"대답해.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1484,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1115","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Alright...\"","korean":"\"알겠어...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1485,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1119","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She interrogates me, her face solemn, and I recount every last thing the girl told me.","korean":"누나가 굳은 얼굴로 캐묻는 바람에, 나는 그 애가 한 말을 하나도 빠짐없이 털어놓는다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1486,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1126","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Hmm. So that girl has loved you since last year.\"","korean":"\"흠. 그 애는 작년부터 널 좋아했구나.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1487,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1134","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"She sounds like a pleasant and honest girl. It sounds like she knows a lot about you, too.\"","korean":"\"착하고 솔직한 애 같네. 준형이에 대해서도 많이 아는 것 같고.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1488,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1138","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Y-Yeah...\"","korean":"\"으, 응...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1489,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1142","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Uhhh, I'm starting to get pretty spooked here! She's normally super nice, but...","korean":"어어... 점점 무서워진다! 평소엔 엄청 상냥한데...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1490,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1150","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"And? Why are you so depressed about a girl admitting she loves you like that?\"","korean":"\"그래서? 그렇게 사랑한다고 고백받았는데 왜 우울해?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1491,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1154","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"B-Because of my cowardice...\"","korean":"\"내, 내가 겁쟁이라서...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1492,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1159","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Cowardice?\"","korean":"\"겁쟁이?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1493,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1164","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Y-Yeah... She told me about her feelings, and was really sincere. But I ended up turning her away without even knowing why...\"","korean":"\"으, 응... 진심으로 마음을 고백했는데, 나는 이유도 모른 채 거절해 버렸어.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1494,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1172","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Eh? Wait, you rejected her?\"","korean":"\"어? 잠깐, 거절했다고?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1495,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1177","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Yeah. And it made her cry as well. I've been trying to figure out why I did it, but I just feel so guilty whenever I think about it.\"","korean":"\"응. 울리기까지 했어. 왜 그랬는지 생각해 봤는데, 생각할 때마다 너무 미안해서...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1496,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1184","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"...\"","korean":"\"...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1497,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1192","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Haha, jeez, it's just that you're a serious and nice person at the same time.","korean":"\"후훗... 정말, 넌 진지하면서도 착하다니까.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1498,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1196","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"W-Why are you laughing?\"","korean":"\"왜, 왜 웃어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1499,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1212","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"No reason, no reason. Haha, but jeez, you're hopeless.\"","korean":"\"아무것도 아니야, 아무것도. 하아... 근데 정말 구제불능이라니까.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1500,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1217","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"That sure is a relief, though.\"","korean":"\"그래도 다행이네.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1501,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1222","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Her mood brightens up and she starts petting my head.","korean":"기분이 풀리더니 머리를 쓰다듬어 준다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1502,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1225","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I'm glad she's not upset anymore, but this is embarrassing...","korean":"화 안 나서 다행이지만, 부끄럽다...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1503,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1231","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"And now you're heartbroken, huh?\"","korean":"\"그래서 지금 마음이 아픈 거야?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1504,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1236","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I mean, I guess...? I know I was the one that rejected her, but still...\"","korean":"\"그런가...? 내가 거절한 건 알지만, 그래도...\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1505,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1248","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Haha. I get it, I get it. Sounds like I should do my best to comfort you, huh?\"","korean":"\"하아... 알겠어, 알겠어. 열심히 위로해 줘야겠네.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1506,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1252","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"She quickly closes the distance between us.","korean":"빠르게 거리를 좁힌다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1507,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1264","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"So, are you interested in having sex with your sister?\"","korean":"\"그래서 누나랑 한번 해 보고 싶은 거야?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1508,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1268","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Eh?\"","korean":"\"어?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1509,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1271","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"For a moment, I thought my ears were playing tricks on me.","korean":"순간 내 귀를 의심했다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1510,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1274","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"But her next words disprove that theory.","korean":"하지만 다음 말이 그 이론을 부정한다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1511,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1284","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Let's have sex. I'll mend your wounded heart.\"","korean":"\"그럼 누나랑 하자. 상처받은 마음은 누나가 달래 줄게.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1512,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1289","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"S-S-S-S-S-Sex?!\"","korean":"\"세, 세, 세, 세, 섹스?!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1513,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1295","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Yup.\"","korean":"\"응.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1514,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1298","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"My mind has gone blank.","korean":"머리가 하얘진다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1515,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1302","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"H-Having sex with Seohee-noona...?! With my sister?! For real?!","korean":"서희 누나랑 한다고...? 친누나랑?! 정말로?!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1516,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1311","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"You've been waiting to do it, haven't you? You've been thinking about doing something like that with me the moment I brought you into my room.\"","korean":"\"계속 기다리고 있었지? 누나가 방으로 데려온 순간부터 이런 생각 하고 있었잖아.\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1517,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1315","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"Th-That's...!\"","korean":"\"그, 그건...!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1518,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1319","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I can't deny that. She's right.","korean":"부정할 수 없다. 맞다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1519,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1323","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"We've been up to a lot of naughty shenanigans lately, so yeah, it crossed my mind as soon as I walked in here.","korean":"요즘 야한 일을 많이 했으니까, 방에 들어오는 순간부터 그런 생각이 들었다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1520,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1326","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I've been waiting for her to suggest we do something, just like she said.","korean":"말대로 뭔가 제안해 주길 기다리고 있었다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1521,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1329","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"B-B-But I never thought that it would be full-blown sex!","korean":"하, 하지만 진짜 끝까지 하게 될 줄은 몰랐어!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1522,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1333","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I'm not even happy about it, necessarily! I didn't even imagine we'd go THIS far!","korean":"꼭 기쁜 것도 아니야! 이렇게까지 갈 줄은 상상도 못 했어!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1523,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1336","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"W-What should I do?!","korean":"어, 어떻게 하지?!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1524,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1342","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Junhyung... don't you want to do it?\"","korean":"\"준형아... 하고 싶지 않아?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1525,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1347","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I-I want to!\"","korean":"\"하, 하고 싶어!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1526,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1351","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I answer without thinking.","korean":"생각 없이 대답한다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1527,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1355","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Something inside me practically answers for me, just like when that girl confessed to me.","korean":"그 여자애가 고백했을 때처럼, 내 안의 무언가가 나보다 먼저 대답해 버렸다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1528,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1360","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I know why, though. I know that I consciously turned that girl away, and I tried to convince myself that it was unconscious.","korean":"이유는 알고 있다. 나는 의식적으로 그 애를 거절해 놓고, 무의식적으로 그런 것뿐이라고 스스로를 속이려 했다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1529,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1364","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I tried to shut myself down with reasoning and ideas of normalcy.","korean":"상식과 이성이라는 말로 내 마음을 억눌러 왔다.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1530,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1367","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"I did it to avoid accepting what my heart truly longs for...","korean":"내 마음이 진짜 원하는 것을 인정하지 않으려고 그랬던 거다...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1531,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1370","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"But I... I...!","korean":"하지만 나는... 나는...!","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1532,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1377","kind":"text","speaker":"서희","english":"\"Heh. Then how about we head to my bed?\"","korean":"\"헤. 그럼 침대로 갈까?\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"✓","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1533,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1381","kind":"text","speaker":"준형","english":"\"I-I'd love to!\"","korean":"\"하, 가고 싶어!\"","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1534,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1385","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"Because I have always, always loved...","korean":"나는 오래전부터, 언제나 사랑해 왔으니까...","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""},
{"rowNumber":1535,"id":"01姉_00_05.ks#1388","kind":"text","speaker":"나레이션","english":"... my dearest sister, Seohee-noona.","korean":"...가장 소중한 누나, 서희 누나를.","recordingScript":"","memo":"","voice":"","phaseId":""}
